{
  "id": 19,
  "name": "cluster_aware_return_weighted",
  "intent": "Augment return-aware nearest neighbor with a cluster density bonus and an isolation penalty, and modulate return weight by progress to favor closing the tour later. This biases toward candidates embedded in dense remaining regions while still penalizing long jumps, improving initial tour quality for the 2-opt refinement.",
